| R6 | 1 | 2 | 1 | 1 | 2 | 1 | 3 | 2 |
| R7 | 1 | 3 | 1 | 0 | 2 | 2 | 3 | 1 |
| R8 | — | 2 | — | 1 | 2 | 1 | 2 | 2 |

> Takeaway: late rounds carry FEWER decisions than mid for: skilled, martyr, chalk, hoarder, ironhands, martyr-worst — repetition-risk flag.


